---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact & collaboration" description="Contact UXO.ECO for sources, corrections, collaboration, translation requests, and educational use.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">Contact UXO.ECO</p><h1>Research. Education. Collaboration. Field knowledge.</h1><p class="lead">We welcome contact from researchers, clearance organizations, governments, educators, journalists, environmental organizations, affected communities, artists, photographers, translators, and people with knowledge that may improve this resource.</p><p><a class="action-link" href="mailto:hello@uxo.eco">hello@uxo.eco</a></p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container split"><div><h2>Ways to contribute.</h2></div><ol class="numbered"><li><span>01</span><div><h3>Share information or corrections</h3><p>Reports, datasets, historical records, photographs, video, source material, or a correction to something we have published.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><h3>Collaborate</h3><p>Research, education, translation, mapping, design, awareness work, or another responsible project connection.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><h3>Clearance organizations</h3><p>We especially welcome contact from organizations doing professional clearance, remediation, risk education, or related field work.</p></div></li><li><span>04</span><div><h3>Media and educational use</h3><p>Questions about UXO.ECO material, the UXO symbol, interviews, or classroom and public-interest use.</p></div></li><li><span>05</span><div><h3>General contact</h3><p>If your message does not fit a category, it is still welcome.</p></div></li></ol></div></section>
  <section class="section section--quiet"><div class="container split"><div><p class="eyebrow">Translation</p><h2>Request a language, or flag a problem.</h2></div><div class="copy"><p>Translations are not yet published on UXO.ECO. You can request a language, offer translation support, or report wording that is unclear or inaccurate in an existing translation by emailing <a href="mailto:hello@uxo.eco?subject=Translation%20request%20or%20issue">hello@uxo.eco</a>.</p><p>Please include the page link, the language or locale, and—where relevant—the wording you are concerned about. Translation should preserve safety meaning and local terminology; it is not a substitute for official local emergency guidance.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container split"><div><p class="eyebrow">Future direction</p><h2>Clearance support, honestly stated.</h2></div><div class="copy"><p>UXO.ECO hopes to directly support or fund documented UXO clearance efforts in the future. We do not currently represent that we fund clearance work.</p><p>When that changes, it should be specific, transparent, and tied to the work being supported.</p></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
